\section bugs Reporting Bugs

Report bugs in the code or errors/omissions in the documentation via <a
href="https://github.com/RhysU/ESIO/issues">https://github.com/RhysU/ESIO/issues</a>.
All bug reports should include:
<ul>
  <li>the version number of the ESIO library,</li>
  <li>the version number of the HDF5 library,</li>
  <li>the vendor and version number of the MPI stack,</li>
  <li>the hardware and operating system,</li>
  <li>the local compiler version number,</li>
  <li>a description of the bug behavior, and ideally, </li>
  <li>a short program which reproduces the bug.</li>
</ul>
Feature requests are welcome.  Contributions, especially as pull requests, are
doubly welcome.

